   "text": "Lancaster University Leipzig - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nLancaster University Leipzig\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLancaster University Leipzig is a branch campus of Lancaster University, UK. LU Leipzig offers a range of degree programmes, with the university committed to providing the same academic quality and fully rounded student experience as in the UK. Lancaster University´s operation in Leipzig has been approved by the Saxon State Ministry for Higher Education, Research and the Arts. The campus is located in the heart of the City of Leipzig and welcomes both German, EU and international students.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:06\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 08:23\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nGermany\nYearly Fees\nMax: €18,163.00\nMin: €15,136.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n100 of 1,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n2019\nCampus(es)\nLeipzig\nCountry\nGermany\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=watQ_pCafj8\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
